---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import HeroSection from '../components/HeroSection.astro';
import LetsTalkSection from "../components/LetsTalkSection.astro";
---

<Layout hasNavbar={false}>
	<HeroSection/>
	<section class="flex flex-col
	px-6 py-11 gap-10
	md:px-24 md:py-30 md:gap-24">
		<div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-12">
			<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-h2 font-semibold text-brand-ink">
				Business-critical software needs stewardship
			</h2>
			<div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-7">
				<p class="text-sm md:text-subtitle1 text-brand-dark-gray">
					Whether you’re building a new product, scaling an established platform, or maintaining the systems
					your business depends on, successful software requires more than implementation. It needs a partner
					that understands the product, practices principled engineering, and stays invested in its long-term
					success.
				</p>
				<a href="/practices" class="text-sm md:text-base font-medium text-brand-primary">
					Learn how we work&ensp;→
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<hr class="border-brand-light-gray"/>
		<div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-12">
			<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-h2 font-semibold text-brand-ink">
				Designed to deliver
			</h2>
			<div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-7">
				<p class="text-sm md:text-subtitle1 text-brand-dark-gray">
					Ambitious outcomes are rarely achieved through a series of short projects. That’s why Lionheart
					Pacific is built around long-term relationships, stable teams, and experienced, cross-functional
					engineers. We deliver the quality you’d expect from a premium engineering firm, at a cost you can
					sustain.
				</p>
				<a href="/services" class="text-sm md:text-base font-medium text-brand-primary">
					See our services&ensp;→
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="bg-brand-concrete flex flex-col
	px-6 py-11 gap-4
	md:px-24 md:py-30 md:gap-12">
		<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-h2 font-semibold text-brand-ink">
			A trusted partner
		</h2>
		<div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-7">
			<blockquote class="border-l-4 border-brand-primary pl-4 md:pl-7">
				<p class="text-sm md:text-[22px] md:leading-[34px] italic text-brand-dark-gray">
					Partnering with Lionheart Pacific has been one of the best decisions we’ve made. They bring
					thoughtful judgment, real ownership, and a depth of experience that’s difficult to find. We’ve
					trusted them with software that’s critical to our business, and they’ve consistently been invested
					in our long-term success as if it were their own.
				</p>
			</blockquote>
			<div class="text-sm md:text-base">
				<div class="font-semibold text-brand-ink">John Doe, Co-Founder</div>
				<div class="text-brand-mid-gray">ACME LLC — Inc. 5000, 2025 &amp; 2026</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	<LetsTalkSection
			body="What are you building? We’d love to learn about your business, the challenges you’re facing, and where you’re headed."/>
</Layout>
